-- aar/w3/aar_row_601_draft2.sql. DRAFT 2 by W3 (session_01H1X3ANsGiMnhnbkfphocmo) for the coordinator (seat 36), on its orders of about 12:24 and 14:45 CST 2026-11-24. Draft 1 (84bd102c, W1 PASS Wall 11655) was never inserted. CHANGES FROM DRAFT 1, and nothing else: the engine manual entry is now WRITTEN (manuals; the reason text); run 42283 is added as run evidence, in part (reason text; run_evidence); Wall 11657, 11666 and 11669 join the sources; audit 41604 joins audit_ids; the engine manual parts join objects. NOT RUN by W3. For a W1 grade, then the operator's press, then insert from seat 36.
